OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy but
OL,6,Fmostly dry in the evening with just a
OL,7,Ffew spots of light rain. Rain will
OL,8,Fturn more persistent and occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy overnight. Becoming breezy
OL,10,Faround the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy with persistent and
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy rain in the
OL,14,Fmorning. Staying cloudy throughout the
OL,15,Fday but rain gradually easing. Drier
OL,16,Fin the west. Windy at times,
OL,17,Fparticularly around the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
